{
    "title": "Phone Locator: Family Location",
    "description": "Phone Locator is an accurate and reliable GPS location sharing app that helps you find and track your family & friends in a easy and safe way. With mutual consent and exclusive code/number sharing, you can effortlessly geolocate your family and friends, whether they are at home, on the road, or on the go. Download Phone Tracker to have family's location at your fingertips!\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\ud83d\udccd Real-time Location Tracking: Keep your family safe by tracking their real-time location, even when the app is running in the background. This feature is particularly useful for monitoring the whereabouts of your kids and older family members.\r\n\u26a1 Accurate and Fast Place Alert: Create custom places and receive instant notifications when someone enters or exits those places. Stay informed with fast and real-time location updates, ensuring you are always up to date.\r\n\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc66 Unlimited Members: Add as many family members as you want to your network and access their location history without any additional charges.\r\n\ud83d\udd0b Detailed Battery Information: Stay informed about the battery charge level and status of your family members' devices. This feature helps you avoid losing touch with older family members and kids by notifying you of any abnormalities.\r\n\r\nHow to Use:\r\nInstall the Phone Locator app on your device and the devices of your family members.\r\nObtain your unique and exclusive code/number and share it with your family.\r\n\r\nThat's it! Once they accept your request, you can start sharing safe location information within a private network.\r\n\r\nRest assured that your GPS location sharing is only possible when both parties allow it. We prioritize your privacy and data security, and our app only requests a few necessary permissions, primarily the location permission, to protect your online privacy.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Phone Locator is an accurate and reliable GPS location sharing app that helps you find and track your family &amp; friends in a easy and safe way. With mutual consent and exclusive code/number sharing, you can effortlessly geolocate your family and friends, whether they are at home, on the road, or on the go. Download Phone Tracker to have family&#39;s location at your fingertips!<br><br>Key Features:<br>\ud83d\udccd Real-time Location Tracking: Keep your family safe by tracking their real-time location, even when the app is running in the background. This feature is particularly useful for monitoring the whereabouts of your kids and older family members.<br>\u26a1 Accurate and Fast Place Alert: Create custom places and receive instant notifications when someone enters or exits those places. Stay informed with fast and real-time location updates, ensuring you are always up to date.<br>\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc66 Unlimited Members: Add as many family members as you want to your network and access their location history without any additional charges.<br>\ud83d\udd0b Detailed Battery Information: Stay informed about the battery charge level and status of your family members&#39; devices. This feature helps you avoid losing touch with older family members and kids by notifying you of any abnormalities.<br><br>How to Use:<br>Install the Phone Locator app on your device and the devices of your family members.<br>Obtain your unique and exclusive code/number and share it with your family.<br><br>That&#39;s it! Once they accept your request, you can start sharing safe location information within a private network.<br><br>Rest assured that your GPS location sharing is only possible when both parties allow it. We prioritize your privacy and data security, and our app only requests a few necessary permissions, primarily the location permission, to protect your online privacy.",
